flowchart TD
    A([Start printOTAInfo])

    A --> B[Get Running Partition]
    B --> C[Get Boot Partition]
    C --> D[Get Next OTA Partition]
    D --> E[Find OTA Slot 0]
    E --> F[Find OTA Slot 1]

    F --> G[Print OTA Information Header]
    G --> H[Print Firmware Version]
    H --> I[Print Build Date & Time]

    I --> J{Running Partition Exists?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Print Running Partition]
    J -- No --> L

    K --> L
    L --> M{Boot Partition Exists?}

    M -- Yes --> N[Print Boot Partition]
    M -- No --> O

    N --> O
    O --> P{Next OTA Target Exists?}

    P -- Yes --> Q[Print Next OTA Target]
    P -- No --> R

    Q --> R

    R --> S{OTA Slot 0 Exists?}

    S -- Yes --> T[Print Slot 0<br/>Label, Address, Size]
    S -- No --> U

    T --> U

    U --> V{OTA Slot 1 Exists?}

    V -- Yes --> W[Print Slot 1<br/>Label, Address, Size]
    V -- No --> X

    W --> X

    X --> Y[Print Footer]
    Y --> Z([Return])
